---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: help_output(args)
---
Show the signed-in account, token expiry, client ID and scopes

Usage: ms-todo auth status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format [default: table in a terminal, json when piped] [possible values: table, json]
      --instance <NAME>  Use a separate copy of ms-todo's data (also MS_TODO_INSTANCE). Builds run from Cargo's target/ directory default to "dev"
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
